(text "CH1  75S VFO (PTO) INJECTION  2.5 - 2.7 MHz  ->  GPIO27\nJ2/J3 = SMA.  J2 -> J3 is a straight 75S -> 32S pass-through; the meter only taps it through C11 + R4 (~1 k, ~3 pF load).\n-IN sits ~25 mV above +IN (R7 1M) so the output is quiet with no signal.  Sensitivity ~60 mVpp." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c69cf0b8-0f26-40f5-92f1-205f658625fc"))
