(text "PTT INPUT  ->  GPIO4 (net PTT, low = TX as in main.c)\nJP9 OPEN (default): keying VOLTAGE 4-30 V on PTT_IN = TX.  Q3 on -> GPIO4 low.\nJP9 FITTED: R45 pulls PTT_IN to +5 V for a contact closure to GND = TX.\n   This inverts the sense (closure -> Q3 off -> GPIO4 high): flip PTT_RX / PTT_TX in main.c.\nD14 (12 V zener) + R43/R44 protect the 2N7000 gate.  R46 pulls GPIO4 up to 3.3 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 383.54 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5dd1851-8101-4c89-a056-35e1bb33c57f"))
