(text "R16: gate loopback GPIO13 (LEDC 2 Hz gate) -> GPIO12 (PCNT level input).\nR17/JP2: self-test GPIO15 (1 MHz LEDC) -> GPIO2.  JP2 open by default (both are boot strapping pins)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6b50ed48-b91e-42ba-a21b-2311e731e179"))
(text "DISPLAY: 20x4 HD44780 LCD + PCF8574 I2C backpack (addr 0x27), powered from 5 V.\n2N7000 level shifter: ESP32 GPIO is not 5 V tolerant, PCF8574 VIH = 0.7*VDD = 3.5 V.\nJ6 = 1x4 2.54 mm header, pin order as on the common backpack: GND VCC SDA SCL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300 176 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0867b3af-aa3e-410b-a628-ccabced364f0"))
